---
const reasons = [
  {
    title: 'Built for looks, not leads',
    desc: 'Most sites prioritize aesthetics over conversion. We structure every page to capture intent and reduce friction.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Weak local SEO foundation',
    desc: 'Without proper schema, GBP alignment, and technical setup, you\'re invisible when prospects search nearby.',
  },
  {
    title: 'No clear next step',
    desc: 'Vague CTAs and buried contact forms cost you calls. We design obvious, low-friction paths to inquiry.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Outdated and neglected',
    desc: 'Stale content, slow load times, and security gaps hurt trust and rankings. Care plans keep you ready.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section-padding bg-stone-50">
  <div class="content-width">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="heading-lg mb-6">Why Most Local Business Websites Don't Convert</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg mb-8">We've audited hundreds of NJ service business sites. The same patterns show up again and again—and they're fixable.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-6">
          {reasons.map((r) => (
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1e3a5f]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#1e3a5f]" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
            </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">{r.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-stone-600">{r.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <img src="/images/why-most-fail.webp" alt="Website audit showing conversion gaps and improvement opportunities" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-md object-cover aspect-[4/3] max-h-[280px]" width="500" height="375" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 card-elevated">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-4">Ready to see how your site stacks up?</p>
        <p class="text-stone-600 mb-6">Get a free audit. We'll show you exactly where you're losing leads and what to fix first.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-white bg-[#1e3a5f] hover:bg-[#2d4a6f]">Get a Free Website & SEO Audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
